@startuml cu77
!theme plain
title CU77 — Monitoreo de Operaciones y Gestión de Incidentes

actor "Operations team (Equipo de Operaciones)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : Users operate the notarial system from PCs and notebooks.
System -> System : Operations team
Actor -> Actor : The system exposes health metrics and structured logs.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Prometheus scrapes metrics on a schedule.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Stores time series of memory use, threads, latency, and connections.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : An anomaly threshold is detected (for example, response > 10s or error > 1%).
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Grafana Alerting fires a notification to the on-call channel.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The on-call engineer analyzes the incident with Loki logs and dashboards.
System -> System : On-call engineer
Actor -> Actor : Identifies the root cause and runs the mitigation or rollback procedure.
System -> System : On-call engineer

@enduml
